      "content": "The idea that you are inherently flawed is a powerful and painful belief, but it is a narrative, not a fact. That feeling of being a \"spectator\" might be a symptom of disconnection, which can be addressed, not a permanent feature of your soul. Many people struggle with feeling this way, and connecting with others on a deeper, authentic level is a process, not an instant switch. Please know that your existence is valuable, and help can guide you toward finding connection and purpose again.",
